cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this software supports your research, please cite it, and cite the six server versions it installed."
title: "bibliograph-mcp: a suite of MCP servers for scholarly search with typed envelopes and query receipts"
abstract: >-
  The suite package for six Model Context Protocol servers — CiNii Research,
  J-STAGE, NDL Search, KCI/Open Access Korea, OpenAlex and Semantic Scholar —
  that answer with one typed JSON envelope and deposit hash-chained query
  receipts to one ledger. Installs the six at pinned release tags from GitHub and registers
  them in Claude Desktop together.
type: software
